    "scale_anchor_mm": 120,
    "assembly_notes": "The lift_off_hinge part models the complete hinge body-half assembly: a main member (mounting wall plus upper and lower parallel extensions) is secured to the vehicle body, and a U-shaped link member is pivotally connected to it by the vertical pintle pin passing through coaxial holes in the extensions and the legs of the U-link. The door-half member (bight wall with two sidewalls) carries an inwardly-extending leaf flange whose pintle-pin hole drops over the pintle pin for lift-off engagement, while a stop cylinder limits rotation to the predetermined lift-off position."
  }
}